  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "たまを　ささえる　からだはほとんど　うごかないため　ほんたいはたまのなかにいると　かんがえられている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "구슬을 지탱하는 몸은 거의 움직이지 않기 때문에, 구슬 안에 본체가 있는 것으로 여겨지고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "支撐球的身體幾乎不動，因此人們認為牠的本體其實是在球裡面。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le corps qui porte la sphère bouge à peine. On se demande donc si c’est bien lui qui contrôle les actions de ce Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Körper, der die Kugel stützt, regt sich kaum. Daher nimmt man an, dass sich der wahre Körper des Pokémon im Inneren der Kugel befindet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El cuerpo que sostiene la bola apenas se mueve, por lo que se cree que el cuerpo en el interior de esta es quien controla sus acciones.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La parte del corpo che sostiene la sfera si muove pochissimo. C’è chi ritiene che il suo vero corpo sia quello all’interno della sfera stessa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The body that supports the ball barely moves. Therefore, it is thought that the true body of this Pokémon is actually inside the ball.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "玉を　支える　体はほとんど　動かないため　本体は玉の中にいると　考えられている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "支撑着球的身体几乎不动，因此人们认为它的本体其实是在球里面。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El cuerpo que sostiene la bola apenas se mueve, por lo que se cree que el cuerpo en el interior de esta es quien controla sus acciones.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たまのなかに　あかんぼうが　ねむる。ここちよく　ねむれるように　あしでたまを　まわして　あやしているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "구슬 안에는 아이가 잠들어 있다. 편하게 잠들 수 있게 다리로 구슬을 굴려서 달랜다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "為了讓在球裡睡覺的寶寶可以睡得更加香甜，會用腳轉著球，讓寶寶感到安穩。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il fait doucement tourner sa sphère avec ses pattes afin d’assurer le confort du nouveau-né qui dort à l’intérieur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Im Inneren seiner Kugel schläft ein Junges. Skarabaks dreht die Kugel besänftigend mit seinen Beinen, damit dieses gemütlich schläft.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mece la bola suavemente con las patas para asegurar el plácido sueño de la crisálida que duerme en su interior.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Con le zampe ruota la sfera per cullare e fare dormire serenamente il piccolo che si trova al suo interno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "An infant sleeps inside the ball. Rabsca rolls the ball soothingly with its legs to ensure the infant sleeps comfortably.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "玉の中に　赤ん坊が　眠る。心地よく　眠れるように　脚で玉を　まわして　あやしているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "为了能让睡在球里面的宝宝睡得更香甜，会用脚转动球，让宝宝感到安心。",
